// Diagnostic code registry (spec 13.4). THE single source of truth for every diagnostic code.
//  - A code is a stable identifier: never change its meaning, never reuse a retired code.
//  - A duplicate code fails the build (static_assert in diag.cpp); an unregistered code used in the
//    sources fails `make test` (tests/check_codes.sh).
//  - Build system / packages (stage 5): E0701-E0720, W0701-W0702.
//  - Preprocessor: E0601-E0609, E0613, E0614, W0601, W0602 (W0602 retired: `#`/`##` are implemented, never reuse it).  try/access/overload/bounds: E0610-E0612, E0621, E0630-E0650.
